  "integrationNotes": {
    "strategy": "Hybrid deterministic procedural rack with SF64. VIBE biases sound choice; loop variations retain the same selected rack.",
    "drumSafety": "Only verified full-kit presets are selected for DRUMS because many bank-128 programs are partial layers.",
